 dilapidated in Grim  Morpheus reunites with the realm's chief  librarian Lucian and learns that most of  the residents have left due to a lack of  leadership hearing all of this he is  devastated but nonetheless he vows to  rebuild his realm back to its glorious  image on the other hand the nightmare  Corinthian is seen in an apartment with  his latest victim he knows that his  creator Morpheus has escaped captivity  and is going to come for for him soon  then we are shown why Corinthian  actually wears sunglasses in the sockets  where his eyes should be he has a rows  of teeth like tiny mouths he is known  for his trademark of killing people by  cutting out their eyes back in the  dreaming realm Morpheus explains to  Lucian that he is nothing without his  weapons his pouch helmet Ruby thus if he  wants to rebuild his realm he has to  find them first following this we are  taken to Buffalo New York where an older  Ethel is hiding out from society she  appears to be an international criminal  living multiple lives one day she is  greeted by Corinthian who proposes a  partnership between them as they are  both enemies of Morpheus Ethel  immediately agrees and thus they begin  their Alliance when they are planning on  how to tackle the situation Ethel tries  to lie that she does not know where  morpheus's weapons are but Corinthian  brings up her son and proves he knows  more than she initially thought back in  his Palace Morpheus explains that the  only way to get back his weapons is by  summoning the trio of goddesses known as  the fates but for this he needs  something powerful from which he can  absorb power hence Morpheus visits two  dream Brothers wanting to take back a  gift he gave them a long time ago it  turns out the gift is an adorable  dinosaur named Gregory which the  brothers love very much they are  reluctant to let him go but Gregory  himself agrees to sacrifice himself for  the sake of his creator with this  Morpheus drops to his knees and absorbs  t